- `.claude/agents/posting-scorer.md` - from `.claude/agents/posting-scorer.md`
  (read-only scoring agent pattern), minus the portal-CLI escalation
- `.claude/commands/run-alerts.md` - from `.claude/commands/rank.md` (batch
