- `expand/expand.md` - adapted from ai-job-search .claude/commands/expand.md
  (competency expansion: discovery, A/B direct-lookup-plus-inference
  enrichment, categorized source-attributed deduplicated map, grouped
  summary with all/review/skip confirmation, source report), rebased on a
